Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json
```

**Request Body:**
```json
{
    "name": "Samsung Galaxy S24",
    "description": "Latest Samsung flagship smartphone",
    "price": 899.99,
    "stockQuantity": 75,
    "categoryId": 1,
    "imageUrl": "https://example.com/samsung-s24.jpg"
